{
  "name": "Validate HubSpot contact emails weekly and write the status back with LeadMagic",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HubSpot email hygiene\n\n### How it works\n1. Every Sunday, pulls HubSpot contacts with an email.\n2. LeadMagic validates each address.\n3. The status (`valid`, `invalid`, or `unknown`) and mail provider are written to two contact properties, so you can suppress bounces and segment by provider.\n\n### Setup\n1. In HubSpot, create the contact properties `leadmagic_email_status` and `leadmagic_mx_provider` (single-line text).\n2. Select a HubSpot app token credential in both HubSpot nodes.\n3. Select your LeadMagic credential.\n\n### Customization\nUse a HubSpot list or filter in **Get contacts** to check only new or recently changed contacts. `unknown` results (including catch-all domains) are free.\n\nRequires the [LeadMagic community node](https://github.com/LeadMagic/leadmagic-n8n#install) (`n8n-nodes-leadmagic`). Tested with n8n 2.47 and n8n-nodes-leadmagic 1.8.0.",
        "height": 660,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "6bf0d997-f6d5-56de-bf04-0bc99ce179c5",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                0
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 3
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "2473b3b2-dab0-5b0e-9189-aafc0e4b65f6",
      "name": "Every Sunday",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "operation": "search",
        "limit": 500,
        "additionalFields": {
          "properties": [
            "email",
            "firstname",
            "lastname"
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "90f7b704-e0a6-57f4-a8e5-9d582b4fa353",
      "name": "Get contacts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 4
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.properties?.email }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c8542ca3-8a6c-5e49-8ff3-44686d22aabb",
      "name": "Has an email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "email",
        "operation": "validateEmail",
        "inputMode": "single",
        "email": "={{ $json.properties.email }}",
        "outputMode": "selected",
        "outputFields": [
          "email_status",
          "mx_provider"
        ]
      },
      "id": "c9331f49-8027-5bec-bc76-47cff1304ea4",
      "name": "Validate email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-leadmagic.leadMagic",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "email": "={{ $('Has an email').item.json.properties.email }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "customPropertiesUi": {
            "customPropertiesValues": [
              {
                "property": "leadmagic_email_status",
                "value": "={{ $json.email_status ?? 'error' }}"
              },
              {
                "property": "leadmagic_mx_provider",
                "value": "={{ $json.mx_provider ?? '' }}"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "5d0d8082-deb3-5b13-bc2f-d9be06177262",
      "name": "Update contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every Sunday": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get contacts",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get contacts": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Has an email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Has an email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Validate email",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Validate email": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Update contact",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": []
}
